// SimplicityCovenantTerms is a FUNDED, self-enforcing resting order under the
// Simplicity template seqdex/order (sequentia-contracts, templates/seqdex_order):
// one program for every order, these terms held as data in a leaf beside it,
//
//	P2TR(NUMS, TapBranch(TapLeaf_0xbe(program), H_TapData(terms)))
//
// A taker re-derives the output from the terms and its own pinned commitment
// root (pkg/covenant SimOrder), with no compiler, and fills it alone: the
// maker is paid at output 2k at least ceil(filled * rate_num / rate_den) of
// asset_b, compared on 128-bit products, so any 64-bit amount and price fills;
// a partial fill rests again at 2k+1 under the same script. The refund key
// takes the coin back once the lock time reaches expiry_locktime. As for
// CovenantTerms, the outpoint is chain state the relay's watcher re-points
// after a partial fill, outside the signed bytes, and the relay lists the
// order at what its outpoint holds.
